<p>Heftel Broadcasting Corporation is the largest Spanish language radio broadcaster in the United States and currently owns or operates 37 radio stations in the top-ten Hispanic markets and Las Vegas. As of the Spring Arbitron ratings book, the Company owned or operated the number one rated station in any English or Spanish format in three markets, including Los Angeles. The Company also owned or operated the number one rated Spanish station in ten out of the eleven markets in which the Company operates.</p>
